WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.450
Regular means equal sides and equal angles.

2
00:00:04.101 --> 00:00:06.926
A square is the regular quadrilateral.

3
00:00:07.528 --> 00:00:10.428
One more side: a regular pentagon.

4
00:00:14.697 --> 00:00:18.547
Move one corner. Still a pentagon, but now irregular.
